{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.mp4?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The tower defense base builder you never realized you wanted!<br>Straight out of a fever dream, here is... Ooglians!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What are Ooglians?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.mp4?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ooglians are a mysterious species.<br>It's unknown whether they are technophobes or destructophiles,<br>but they sure love smashing machinery to bits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are not an Ooglian.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/6b8c51e499e549720826584b0ad0bca8.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/6b8c51e499e549720826584b0ad0bca8.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>You are... you. It's not up to me to tell you who you are.<br><i>Why</i> are you on this planet?<br><i>What</i> is your goal?<br>It is, as of now, unknown. Maybe if you protect your reactor, you'll find out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> Build the base around your reactor<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> Ooglians are attracted by the machinery<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> Ooglians try to destroy your base<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/06366c8727c328e12443157e635dc980.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/06366c8727c328e12443157e635dc980.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> Build more machines to defend your base<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> Attract more ooglians<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> It's a game loop<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> You lose <span class=\"bb_strike\">when</span> if your reactor dies<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/673586455b06fe393a3cbbc7f7ff1243.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/673586455b06fe393a3cbbc7f7ff1243.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/673586455b06fe393a3cbbc7f7ff1243.mp4?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b639963bfd670d2de2ce74162412f05c.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=520 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b639963bfd670d2de2ce74162412f05c.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/edc9e3528a373e0feab6c6ae60d2bf57.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=198 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/edc9e3528a373e0feab6c6ae60d2bf57.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2162070?t=1706622774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1706622774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1706622774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1706622774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><br><br>There is a lot of stuff to add to Ooglians, and we want <strong>YOU</strong> to be a part of the process!<br>Community feedback is key for prioritizing what to work on next, such as<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Expand base building<br></li><li>Add more ooglian types<br></li><li>Polish existing gameplay<br></li><li>Add non-gameplay stuff like stats, achievements, high-score</li></ul><br>Head on over to our Discord and let us know what you want to see in the game next!<br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.mp4?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The tower defense base builder you never realized you wanted!<br>Straight out of a fever dream, here is... Ooglians!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What are Ooglians?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.mp4?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ooglians are a mysterious species.<br>It's unknown whether they are technophobes or destructophiles,<br>but they sure love smashing machinery to bits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are not an Ooglian.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/6b8c51e499e549720826584b0ad0bca8.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/6b8c51e499e549720826584b0ad0bca8.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>You are... you. It's not up to me to tell you who you are.<br><i>Why</i> are you on this planet?<br><i>What</i> is your goal?<br>It is, as of now, unknown. Maybe if you protect your reactor, you'll find out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> Build the base around your reactor<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" width=24 height=24 /></picture></span> Ooglians are attracted by the machinery<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.apng?t=1706622774\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati